  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A magnet is cut in four equal parts by cutting it parallel to its length. The time period of each part, if the time period of the original magnet in the same field is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>, will be</p>\r"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "For each part, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi>MB</mi></mfrac></mfenced></msqrt></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>"
